WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

The MIT licence above applies to the software in this repository: the system
code, sheets, templates, stylesheets and the tools under scripts/.

IT DOES NOT APPLY TO THE INVISIBLE SUN GAME ITSELF.

Invisible Sun, and all associated names, terms, mechanics and text, are the
property of Monte Cook Games, LLC. This is an unofficial fan-made system for
playing Invisible Sun on Foundry Virtual Tabletop, produced under the Monte
Cook Games Fan Use Policy. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
published by Monte Cook Games.

No Invisible Sun rules text is distributed with this system. The tools under
scripts/ let an owner of the books generate compendium content from their own
copy, which is the only supported way to obtain it. Content you generate that
way is derived from your books and remains the property of Monte Cook Games;
it is for your own table's use and must not be redistributed.

If you do not own Invisible Sun, please buy it from Monte Cook Games:
https://www.montecookgames.com/store/product-category/invisible-sun/

