ACKNOWLEDGEMENT

This system began life as a fork of the Boilerplate system by Asacolips
Projects / Foundry Mods (MIT, copyright (c) 2020), and has since been fully
rewritten for Foundry v14's ApplicationV2 and DataModel APIs. No substantial
portion of that code remains, but the debt is worth recording.
